---
description: DB + payments guardrails
globs: supabase/**, packages/db/**, packages/schemas/**
---
- Webhooks are idempotent and signature-verified. Never trust a client-supplied
  amount — re-derive every charge/transfer server-side.
- Validate all input with the shared Zod schemas in packages/schemas.
- Write audit_log entries (via triggers) for state changes on listings, offers,
  escrow_transactions, and bans.
